INSERT INTO News VALUES (1, 'Daring Daylight Caper Baffles Pimp City P.D.', '2002-12-25 00:00:00', 'Police: Over $2M (U.S.) taken in braisen robbery, initial reports claim suspects to look \\"shiney and plastic-like\\". Initial crime composite sketches are posted and the public is urged to contact their local crack dealers to report any possible sightings.', 'From: Claude Balls and Noodles<br />\r\nPNN Pimp City Bureau<br /><br />\r\n<strong>PIMP CITY, Pimpafornia (PNN)<br />\r\nThe parts and service department of Pimp Performance Shop was broken into in recent days, authorities said Monday.</strong><br /><br />\r\nPimp City police spokesman T Dogg Jenkins called the break-in \\"bizarre\\" but said it had no \\"smoking gun\\" connection to the disappearance of a revolutionary bit-stereo system, which has been missing since April 20.<br /><br />\r\n<img src=\\"../../images/member_images/surveillance/pcpd_sketch01.gif\\" width=\\"210\\" height=\\"140\\" name=\\"headPageLeft\\" alt=\\"News Archives\\" align=\\"left\\" />Pimp City Police Department released these sketches early on Wednesday of the suspects as well as the suspected get-away car.<br /><br />\r\nPolice said over $2 million dollars worth of performance parts were taken from the shop.<br /><br />\r\n\\"Sometime between Tuesday and Saturday, the shop of Blind Melon Chittlins had been broken into,\\" Jenkins\\\' police statement said. \\"Blind Melon reported the robbery on Saturday around 7:45 a.m. Police are not revealing the details of the robbery or what exactly was taken.\\"<br /><br />\r\n<img src=\\"../../images/member_images/surveillance/pcpd_sketch02.gif\\" width=\\"210\\" height=\\"95\\" name=\\"headPageLeft\\" alt=\\"News Archives\\" align=\\"left\\" />The statement went on to say that police do not believe the robbery was connected to the disappearance of the bit-stereo system.<br /><br />\r\nAuthorities responded Saturday morning to a report of a break-in after owner Blind Melon returned to the shop after he was done doing blow off hookers\\\' tits.<br /><br />\r\nChittlins had been in Las Vegas earlier Friday night to set up a drug ring in effort to pay outstanding debts to bookies. He said doing this was part of his effort to change his life for the better and get out of a life less appealing.<br /><br />\r\nThe case took a turn last week when police told members of Chittlins\\\' family that the shop may have been just a front for an elaborate drug and prostitution ring after Melon has been photographed with another skank days before his precious bit-stereo system vanished.<br /><br />\r\nDon The Arch Bishop Magic Juan, a spokesman for the missing stereo\\\'s knobs, dials and wires, said Pimp City police showed the components photographs Monday, before they were published in a national tabloid magazine.<br /><br />\r\n\\"The components are asking Chittlins to tell everything he knows and to fully cooperate with the Pimp City Police Department,\\" Magic Juan said. \\"And if Chittlins has nothing to hide, they ask him to prove that.\\"<br /><br />\r\nBlind Melon Chittlins has said the allegations of him participating in prostitution and drug rings is \\"a bunch of farfilknockel\\", but did admit to doing blow off hookers\\\' tits.<br /><br />\r\nThe bit-stereo system was last reported seen the Monday before the supossed theft took place, when Chittlins said he locked up the shop as he left for a \\\'powder break\\\' as he called it. The bit-stereo system was due to make a debut at the Pimp City Car Audio Sound Competition July 4.', 1);
INSERT INTO News VALUES (2, 'Pimp City P.D. Gets Bitch Slapped By Local Street Gang', '2003-01-01 00:00:00', 'After recent rash of robberies through-out the city, police have finally found images of who they\\\'re looking for. Police aren\\\'t sure what to expect next as they have no clues to who the suspects might be.', 'From: Claude Balls and Noodles<br />\r\nPNN Pimp City Bureau<br /><br />\r\n<strong>PIMP CITY, Pimpafornia (PNN)<br />\r\nThe recent rash of robberies has left police with images, still baffeling to police as they have no clue who suspects might be.</strong><br /><br />\r\n<a href=\\"javascript:;\\" onclick=\\"JustSoPicWindow(\\\'../../images/member_images/surveillance/450x430/cabowabo_s.jpg\\\',\\\'450\\\',\\\'430\\\',\\\'BitPimps Robbery Video Surveillance Viewer\\\',\\\'#E4E4E4\\\',\\\'hug image\\\',\\\'0\\\');return document.MM_returnValue\\"><img src=\\"../../images/member_images/surveillance/120x115/cabowabo_s.jpg\\" alt=\\"CaboWabo\\" name=\\"shot_cabowabo_s\\" width=\\"130\\" height=\\"115\\" id=\\"shot_cabowabo_s\\" border=\\"0\\" align=\\"left\\" /></a>Pimp City police spokesman T Dogg Jenkins started the press conference by stating, \\"We\\\'re pissed, we\\\'re cops, we\\\'re supposed to rule things!\\" while sweat poured from his forehead. It was apparent that the P.C.P.D. has no response for a terrified public.<br /><br />\r\nThe most recent robbery was that of a liquor store in the lower east side of Skankton, Pimpafornia, a noted haven for pimps, prostitutes, street pharmaceuticals, and a lack of presence by police. The store, Skankton Liquor Emporium, was the first of all the places robbed in recent months by what is believed to be a gang known as the \\"bitPimps\\", to have a single shred of evidence left showing the perpetrators in action.<br /><br />\r\n<a href=\\"javascript:;\\" onclick=\\"JustSoPicWindow(\\\'../../images/member_images/surveillance/450x430/payaso_s.jpg\\\',\\\'450\\\',\\\'430\\\',\\\'BitPimps Robbery Video Surveillance Viewer\\\',\\\'#E4E4E4\\\',\\\'hug image\\\',\\\'0\\\');return document.MM_returnValue\\"><img src=\\"../../images/member_images/surveillance/120x115/payaso_s.jpg\\" alt=\\"Payaso\\" name=\\"shot_payaso_s\\" width=\\"130\\" height=\\"115\\" id=\\"shot_payaso_s\\" border=\\"0\\" align=\\"left\\" /></a>Police said that in total, the last few months robberies have caused major disruption to the cities commerce and general day to day functionality. \\"People are scared to leave their homes. Businesses are scared to make any more deals with others, hire any new employees, or even fire existing potentials for problems as the retaliation may be far greater than the rewards.\\" said Mayor Manolo Alvares Justo Viamonte Almonte in his statement to the presidential press on Thursday. \\"Our initial goal is to identify the culprits and bring them to justice as swiftly and as soon as possible by whatever means necessary.\\" he continued.<br /><br />\r\n<a href=\\"javascript:;\\" onclick=\\"JustSoPicWindow(\\\'../../images/member_images/surveillance/450x430/shredder_s.jpg\\\',\\\'450\\\',\\\'430\\\',\\\'BitPimps Robbery Video Surveillance Viewer\\\',\\\'#E4E4E4\\\',\\\'hug image\\\',\\\'0\\\');return document.MM_returnValue\\"><img src=\\"../../images/member_images/surveillance/120x115/shredder_s.jpg\\" alt=\\"Shredder\\" name=\\"shot_shredder_s\\" width=\\"130\\" height=\\"115\\" id=\\"shot_shredder_s\\" border=\\"0\\" align=\\"left\\" /></a>When we asked the few people left on the streets, the general feeling was one of \\"un-ease and caution\\" as told by one the people we interviewed. Another spoke of how \\"even the local gang members have stopped hanging out, jacking cars and have gone back to school!\\" but also asked our camera man if he could score some rock.<br /><br />\r\nThe following images have been released from the local police department in efforts to help stop this recent crime wave That has slapped Pimp City in the face like a bitch. The police say that the images are from the security camera at the local liquor store, The Ripple Shack on the corner of Skank Blvd and Yo Momma Ave.The police believe that these suspects are responsible for the recent break in at Tinys garage where four new R-spec motors were stolen along with a case of alloy mufflers.<br /><br />\r\n<a href=\\"javascript:;\\" onclick=\\"JustSoPicWindow(\\\'../../images/member_images/surveillance/450x430/dageneral_s.jpg\\\',\\\'450\\\',\\\'430\\\',\\\'BitPimps Robbery Video Surveillance Viewer\\\',\\\'#E4E4E4\\\',\\\'hug image\\\',\\\'0\\\');return document.MM_returnValue\\"><img src=\\"../../images/member_images/surveillance/120x115/dageneral_s.jpg\\" alt=\\"DaGeneral\\" name=\\"shot_dageneral_s\\" width=\\"130\\" height=\\"115\\" id=\\"shot_dageneral_s\\" border=\\"0\\" align=\\"left\\" /></a>These street racers are out of control, and the police aren\\\'t equiped with enough fire power or horse power to deal with them. One officer said in an interview, \\"I tried to stop one once, but the most I ever saw of his car was a license plate that said SILLA, then he just took off like I was sittin at a Krispy Kreme.\\" This being the point of view inside the department, it\\\'s safe to say there\\\'s a bad moon rising. On a related note, Mayor Manolo Alvares Justo Viamonte Almonte addressed the crisis in a live interview Friday afternoon at 4:15pm as his private jet circled the city, and after several large hits from the bong, he said \\"Dem shits is blowed\\".<br /><br />\r\n<a href=\\"javascript:;\\" onclick=\\"JustSoPicWindow(\\\'../../images/member_images/surveillance/450x430/madsamoan_s.jpg\\\',\\\'450\\\',\\\'430\\\',\\\'BitPimps Robbery Video Surveillance Viewer\\\',\\\'#E4E4E4\\\',\\\'hug image\\\',\\\'0\\\');return document.MM_returnValue\\"><img src=\\"../../images/member_images/surveillance/120x115/madsamoan_s.jpg\\" alt=\\"MadSamoan\\" name=\\"shot_madsamoan_s\\" width=\\"130\\" height=\\"115\\" id=\\"shot_madsamoan_s\\" border=\\"0\\" align=\\"left\\" /></a>\r\nNobody really knows what to expect next in these recent events of epic proportion, not even the P.C.P.D. One thing that seems to be for sure in the minds of the entire city is that this is far from over and the only thing we can expect is more guerrilla-type crimes sprouting up through-out the entire city and surrounding areas.<br /><br />\r\nSigning off for PNN, this is Claude Balls and I. P. Freely, Just two concerned reporters trying to take a bite out of crimes Phat Ass.', 1);
INSERT INTO News VALUES (4, 'Cops Make Bust, Chaos Ensues, Koo-koo Ka-choo', '2003-01-24 00:00:00', 'bitPimps go on mission of personal revenge and are captured by police. Just after a line-up, the newly captured gang strong-arms their way to freedom.', 'From: Claude Balls and Noodles<br />\r\nPNN Pimp City Bureau<br /><br />\r\n<strong>PIMP CITY, Pimpafornia (PNN)<br />\r\nAfter what police are referring to as an elaborately planned contract killing on several PNN reporters, the bitPimps were captured briefly by police when they shot one of the informants while in his vehicle.</strong><br /><br />\r\n<a href=\\"javascript:;\\" onclick=\\"JustSoPicWindow(\\\'../../images/member_images/surveillance/lineup_large.jpg\\\',\\\'640\\\',\\\'350\\\',\\\'BitPimps Robbery Video Surveillance Viewer\\\',\\\'#E4E4E4\\\',\\\'hug image\\\',\\\'0\\\');return document.MM_returnValue\\"><img src=\\"../../images/member_images/surveillance/lineup.jpg\\" width=\\"220\\" height=\\"115\\" name=\\"copyImg\\" alt=\\"News\\" align=\\"left\\" border=\\"0\\" /></a>In recent attempts to bring down the gang of street racers known as the bitPimps, the Pimp City Police Department has failed yet again. The Police responded to a routine call Saturday morning at 4:20am to the local strip club \\"Mr. Pickles Snatch Shack\\" only to find the 5 suspects pictured to the left chiefin it up like they were Bob Marley and the Whalers at a rasta-style B-B-Q, serving up everything \\\'baked\\\' of course.<br /><br />\r\n<img src=\\"../../images/member_images/surveillance/narc_protected.jpg\\" width=\\"210\\" height=\\"175\\" name=\\"copyImg\\" alt=\\"News\\" align=\\"left\\" border=\\"0\\" />Police say they were hiding out there after attempting to kill a PNN reporter turned police informant. Miraculously, the informant, Roberto Domingez Sanchez Diago Pablo Perez survived the massive spraying of bullets from automatic weapons and was listed as \\\'critical\\\' for 3 months down at St. Cocha\\\'s Memorial Hospital. Perez was just recently released from the hospital and is paralyzed from the waste down, he\\\'s now getting used to life in a wheelchair.<br /><br />\r\n<a href=\\"javascript:;\\" onclick=\\"JustSoPicWindow(\\\'../../images/member_images/surveillance/narc_shotup_large.jpg\\\',\\\'445\\\',\\\'300\\\',\\\'BitPimps Robbery Video Surveillance Viewer\\\',\\\'#E4E4E4\\\',\\\'hug image\\\',\\\'0\\\');return document.MM_returnValue\\"><img src=\\"../../images/member_images/surveillance/narc_shotup.jpg\\" width=\\"195\\" height=\\"125\\" name=\\"copyImg\\" alt=\\"News\\" align=\\"right\\" border=\\"0\\" /></a>The suspects had hidden the get-a-way car behind the strip club, two police officers who were getting tea-bagged by prostitutes happened to notice the insignia of the bitPimps and called in for back-up.<br /><br />\r\nThe suspects were arrested and were taken down town. After being booked and finger printed, the suspects were placed in a holding cell until detectives arrived to question them.<br /><br />\r\nUpon arrival, the detectives were amazed to find the suspects waiting for them in their cell with an arsenal of weapons and a bong. The suspects took 2 detectives hostage and swiftly made their escape. Outside sources believe that half of the department is on the bitPimps payroll. \\"The P.C.P.D. can not comment on this at the present time\\" says Pimp City Police Spokesman T Dogg Jenkins.<br /><br />', 1);
INSERT INTO News VALUES (3, 'PNN Goes Undercover In Local Race Gang', '2003-01-11 00:00:00', 'PNN takes on street gangs, 1 crew member turns tricks and another sells drugs. Police look the other way as the \\"implants\\" bring in new evidence.', 'From: Claude Balls and Noodles<br />\r\nPNN Pimp City Bureau<br /><br />\r\n<strong>PIMP CITY, Pimpafornia (PNN)<br />\r\nPNN goes undercover to help police gain evidence and access to the fastlane of street racing gangs, and ends up exposing dirty cops on the wrong side of the law.</strong><br /><br />\r\n<img src=\\"../../images/member_images/surveillance/polaroids.jpg\\" alt=\\"Bribes\\" name=\\"polaroids\\" width=\\"461\\" height=\\"200\\" id=\\"polaroids\\" border=\\"0\\" /><br />\r\nAfter careful, covert, undercover operations by PNN correspondants, our operatives gained access to the secret world of street gang racers. What we found was far more shocking than what we or anyone ever expected, P.C.P.D. taking bribes straight from the same expected culprits of mayhem.<br /><br />\r\nAs shown clearly in the photo\\\'s above, a cop taking bribe money from a local gang, the bitPimps, in return for protection and a piece of their action as well as 2 other cops being threatened and forced with violence to follow the gangs every instruction.<br /><br />\r\nNo one knew the crime ring ran so deeply to include some of the cities own, who is supposed to be helping catch criminals like these. What we learned about gangs like the bitPimps was even more shocking and we\\\'re going to reveal it <em>all</em> to you right here, right now, live, sorta, after the fact.<br /><br />\r\n<strong>Weapons, drugs, money, ho\\\'s they\\\'ve got it all.</strong><br />\r\n<img src=\\"../../images/member_images/surveillance/polaroid_cash.jpg\\" alt=\\"Bribes\\" name=\\"polaroids\\" width=\\"160\\" height=\\"150\\" id=\\"polaroids\\" border=\\"0\\" align=\\"left\\" />\r\nOperatives retrieved these images showing that gangs like the bitPimps have evolved into corporate criminal empires and have access to just about anything and everything at anytime.<br /><br />\r\n\\"We were petrified to see all guns and drugs, they lived like rockstar mobsters!\\", said one implant in one of their reports sent back to headquarters. \\"Every member has a role and contributes to the gang, as well as going on their own \\\'adventures\\\'. Regardless, like the mafia, the bosses <em>always</em> get a cut of the action, so to speak.\\" they continued.<br /><br />\r\n“Unfortunately, life is like that, there are good people and there are bad people.” said Pimp City police spokesman T Dogg Jenkins. “Our recruitment programs are taking measures to weed these types of people out of our pool of training officers. Internal Affairs goal is to make sure that not a single ‘bad cop’ is allowed to neglect the honor of wearing the badge.”, he continued.<br /><br />\r\n<img src=\\"../../images/member_images/surveillance/polaroid_gun.jpg\\" alt=\\"Bribes\\" name=\\"polaroids\\" width=\\"160\\" height=\\"150\\" id=\\"polaroids\\" border=\\"0\\" align=\\"left\\" />When asked by other attending press conference personnel if those last statements were placing the blame of the recent crimes ultimately to the negligence of Internal Affairs, the P.C.P.D. spokesman stormed off the stage.<br /><br />\r\nIt seems that these gangs actually have political ties in our government now and control even more than just petty crimes and robberies around the city. They’re poised to take over more and are now setting their sites on bigger competition. Word has it that several South American street racing gangs were decapitated last year in street rally race, and not on accident as initial police reports claimed.<br /><br />\r\nThe wars have extended past our borders and into neighboring countries. The fear is that a network of bitPimps will be strewn across the globe, controlling portions of their area until the world is at the grasps of their gangs.<br /><br />\r\nThis report brought to you by Claude Balls and Noodles, the fresh-makers.', 1);
INSERT INTO News VALUES (9, 'bitPimps Gang Member Killed Execution Style, P.C.P.D. Clueless', '2003-02-13 00:00:00', 'Police are baffled as a member of the much feared bitPimps Gang is found dead, killed execution style. No clues have been revealed as of yet and P.C.P.D. is once again urging citizens to help identify the killer or killers.', 'From: Claude Balls and Noodles<br />\r\nPNN Pimp City Bureau<br /><br />\r\n<strong>PIMP CITY, Pimpafornia (PNN)<br />\r\nPolice are baffled as a member of the much feared bitPimps Gang is found dead, killed execution style. No clues have been revealed as of yet and P.C.P.D. is once again urging citizens to help identify the killer or killers.</strong><br /><br />\r\nWith no clues or suspects as to why a bitPimps Gang member known as DaGeneral was killed and his body found early Saturday around 4:20 a.m., P.C.P.D. spokesman T Dogg Jenkins called an emergency press conference.<br /><br />\r\n\\"We fear these entire events are leading up to a possible gang-war or at least a changing in the higher ranks of the bitPimps Gang. If that is true, you can expect the city to be at unrest and on full alert as miniature wars break-out all over the city. We will not be able to Protect and Serve the communities as we once could, citizen’s will be on their own.\\", Jenkins said. He went on to say, \\"We’re asking that everyone be extra alert, and please report any information they might have about the crime.\\"<br /><br />\r\nJenkins had set a very desperate mood and then ended his speech with, \\"The victim of the crime is a wanted gang member. Getting him off the streets is a good thing, the way he was taken off the streets was a bad thing. If P.C.P.D. had arrested him, that would be it, he would of likely been sent to jail for the rest of his life or sentenced to death. Now we have a potential for full-scale miniature wars and riots all over the city. This could actually turn the city into a wasteland of lawlessness and criminals abound where chaos, greed, and brutality rule.\\"<br /><br />\r\nWith that, Jenkins introduced the only clue and thought to be piece of evidence they know of to date. \\"Pimp City C.S.I. found several white mink hairs at the scene, they believe it to be from some sort of blanket or possibly a piece of clothing.\\" The Coroner’s office believes the time of death to be around 3:30 a.m. on early Saturday morning.<br /><br />\r\nNo funeral plans have been announced, although the city expects to see the remaining bitPimps gang members hold some sort of showing of respect. The cities officials are also expecting some sort of retaliation or at very least a changing in the higher ranks of bitPimps gang empire as a very high ranking member is dead.', 1);
INSERT INTO News VALUES (6, 'Criminal Activity Expected To Rise As Local Gang Increases In Size', '2003-02-10 00:00:00', 'With all it’s slangin and bangin, the bitPimps are continuously growing in the number of gang members, making P.C.P.D.’s life more difficult and dangerous. Ballers everywhere are flocking to the city to get in and tap a piece of that action.', 'From: Claude Balls and Noodles<br />\r\nPNN Pimp City Bureau<br /><br />\r\n<strong>PIMP CITY, Pimpafornia (PNN)<br />\r\nWith all it’s slangin and bangin, the bitPimps are continuously growing in the number of gang members, making P.C.P.D.’s life more difficult and dangerous. Ballers everywhere are flocking to the city to get in and tap a piece of that action.</strong><br /><br />\r\n<img src=\\"../../images/member_images/pr_new_members.jpg\\" width=\\"461\\" height=\\"160\\" name=\\"copyImg\\" alt=\\"News\\" /><br />\r\nNo matter if their specialty is blingin, bangin, ballin, slangin, hangin, flossin, or executive business management — they’re all welcomed into the bitPimps gang. That’s one reason this vast criminal empire has grown in leaps in bounds in such a short time. Growth is expected to continue and crime is expected to increase while P.C.P.D. presence is expected to decrease along with most current business men’s dong size.<br /><br />\r\nThe city is now full of super-fly, dope rides featuring blingin grills and skatin on Dayton sleds that will send your mom’s nipples to the dashboard! The majority of the population is quickly turning into gang members themselves sporting high-class, glossy, plastic threads and flossin some plastic platinum.<br /><br />\r\nP.C.P.D. has their hands full with constant reports of stolen Bits that once found, usually resort in high-speed persuits that end catastrophy. The crime spree that started Christmas Day with the <a href=\\"http://bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/news/news_postings.php?id=1&from=Home\\">first reports of robberies</a> has now grown to engulf the entire city and is now quickly taking over.<br /><br />\r\nAnother recent development was that of a brand new bitPimp member on the executive level, starting to cut-out a slice of the action for himself in the prostitution industry, an industry once dominated by just one bitPimp. The industry itself has grown in leaps and bounds and now commands more attention. The bitPimps have made it well known that the industry they dominate, will now have 2 bitPimps bosses to take care of business. STD\\\'s are expected to decrease as each boss will now have more pimp control over the hussies in their stabbles.', 1);
INSERT INTO News VALUES (5, 'bitPimps Puts Bling On The Big-Screen, And You Know What Dat Means!', '2003-02-09 00:00:00', 'In a bombshell dropped on the nation, the bitPimps hold a press conference to make a statement about their new up-coming project as film producers and actors.', 'From: Claude Balls and Noodles<br />\r\nPNN Pimp City Bureau<br /><br />\r\n<strong>PIMP CITY, Pimpafornia (PNN)<br />\r\nIn a bombshell dropped on the nation, the bitPimps hold a press conference to make a statement about their new up-coming project as film producers and actors.</strong><br /><br />\r\nDirector Dick Giggleberries, also known for other movies such as, \\"So You Want To Be A Southern Playalistic Spottieottiedopaliscious Baller?\\" and \\"Karen\\\'s Oral Hunger\\", has signed on to the yet un-named film which is scheduled to begin shooting in just 1 month.<br /><br />\r\n<a href=\\"javascript:;\\" onclick=\\"JustSoPicWindow(\\\'../../images/member_images/pr_pimps_hollywood_large.jpg\\\',\\\'560\\\',\\\'375\\\',\\\'BitPimps Robbery Video Surveillance Viewer\\\',\\\'#E4E4E4\\\',\\\'hug image\\\',\\\'0\\\');return document.MM_returnValue\\"><img src=\\"../../images/member_images/pr_pimps_hollywood.jpg\\" width=\\"310\\" height=\\"200\\" name=\\"copyImg\\" alt=\\"News\\" align=\\"left\\" border=\\"0\\" /></a>The press conference, dubbed \\"Pimps Put The <em>Wood</em> In Hollywood\\", was held at the \\"Crabby Bill\\\'s Hotel By The Bay\\" in downtown Pimp City and was open to all press members. The bitPimps, dressed in mink and flossin enough platinum to blind Superman, opened the conference with a table dance from some of their \\"Pimp Trick Gangsta Click Strip Club\\" employees. Immediately following, blunts were passed around to the press community, and with that, the bitPimps set the mood with class, cash and a good buzz.<br /><br />\r\n\\"Da bitPimps came up in hur to be representin what be real in life and the homies that be livin it in da streets\\", said bitPimps Publicist Paulie \\"Tea-Bags\\" Marconi. \\"They came to set this mutha off, and they will.\\", he continued. When asked about the actual details of the movie, Mr. Tea-Bags responeded irrately with, \\"Stay the hell outta our Kool-Aide you stankin ass, no afro pick wearin piece of shit... PLADOW!\\".<br /><br />\r\nWhile no plot outlines or any other information has leaked out about the film project, PNN\\\'s Hollywood beaureu sources say that it is likely that film will be about, guns, drugs, gangs, prostitution, cars, cash and of course plenty of bling-bling action.', 1);
INSERT INTO News VALUES (10, 'Update: bitPimp Member Once Thought Dead - Maybe Just Missing', '2003-03-30 00:00:00', 'In another bombshell dropped on the public and specifically the Pimp City community, P.C.P.D. revealed yesterday that the body once thought to be that of DaGeneral was actually another under-cover informant.', 'From: Claude Balls and Noodles<br />\r\nPNN Pimp City Bureau<br /><br />\r\n<strong>PIMP CITY, Pimpafornia (PNN)<br />\r\nAfter reports poured into a tip hotline setup by P.C.P.D., police are now ordering a second autopsy on the corpse found last week once believed to be that of DaGeneral, a high ranking bitPimps gang member.</strong><br /><br />\r\n<img src=\\"../../images/member_images/surveillance/120x115/dageneral_f.jpg\\" width=\\"130\\" height=\\"115\\" name=\\"copyImg\\" alt=\\"News\\" align=\\"right\\" />Phone lines across the city were tied up as reports of DaGeneral still being alive poured into a hotline setup by police. Police were shocked to hear the allogations as they had just about sealed the case and file it away as another gang member killed.<br /><br />\r\n\\"When our phones started bling, blingin and we answered, there was peeps straight freakin on the crazy tip, we had to just hang up on dem shiats mang.\\" said one hotline employee. When police were asked what they were planning to do about these new developments, spokesman T Dogg Jenkins said, \\"We have no comment right now, we have to get our \\\'ducks in a row\\\' so to speak, so step off fool.\\"<br /><br />\r\nIt\\\'s likely that the P.C.P.D. is going to come out looking like the grade school bloodhound gang after the second autopsy is performed. Many now believe the body found in last weeks gang-style hit was not that of bitPimps gang member DaGeneral but more likely another informant sent to infultrate the inner regime of the bitPimps gang.<br /><br />\r\nThe bitPimps are clearly sending a message to police, and that message is that they are here to stay, they are here to make the rules, and they are here to take over - don\\\'t get in their way.', 1);
INSERT INTO News VALUES (11, 'bitPimps Rip It Up At The Tampa Bay Circuit', '2003-03-03 00:00:00', 'Recently, two bitPimps bosses met down in Tampa Bay, Florida for their annual \\"business meetings\\" that now also serve as a chance to claim \\"bragging rights\\". CaboWabo and payaso rip up the tracks with mad flava and end up battling eachother for the top spot.', 'From: Claude Balls and Noodles<br />\r\nPNN Pimp City Bureau<br /><br />\r\n<strong>PIMP CITY, Pimpafornia (PNN)<br />\r\nRecently, two bitPimps bosses met down in Tampa Bay, Florida for their annual \\"business meetings\\" that now also serve as a chance to claim \\"bragging rights\\". CaboWabo and payaso rip up the tracks with mad flava and end up battling eachother for the top spot.</strong><br /><br />\r\n<img src=\\"../../images/member_images/surveillance/120x115/cabowabo_f.jpg\\" width=\\"130\\" height=\\"115\\" name=\\"copyImg\\" alt=\\"News\\" align=\\"right\\" />As soon as they got their \\"buzz on\\", they got their \\"swerve on\\" and hit some corners in the fly-ass bits they own. The residents of nearby St. Petersburg flocked to witness the spectacular display of skills and daring driving techniques along with blinged out rides that would make Master P envious. Other displays included: \\"The Bit B-Hit\\", \\"Bit-Bud Dump Truck\\", and \\"The Phat Boyz 56\\\' Bud Wrangler\\", all of which turned out to be hits in more ways than one!<br /><br />\r\n<img src=\\"../../images/member_images/surveillance/120x115/payaso_f.jpg\\" width=\\"130\\" height=\\"115\\" name=\\"copyImg\\" alt=\\"News\\" align=\\"right\\" />At first, payaso took a commanding lead, virtually winning every race in every category. After a day of hard racing CaboWabo seemed to get acclimated to the new climate and surroundings and started laying down cans of whoop-ass, particularly in a game of bottle-cap soccer where CW rallied back from a 6-0 score to end it with a 9-10 victory.<br /><br />\r\nAfter the weeks events of racing and modding, the two took time out of their day to sign autographs and visit a nearby pimp school where they imparted some of their wizdom upon the young and eager minds of tomorrow. Later that night the two visited a local club, \\"Miss Kittie\\\'s Hot Asian Teen Slut-O-Rama Superstore\\", located in the heart of the hood, where they held a talent search to recruite 2 new lucky ladies in to the high-class, high-dollar world of the bitPimps.<br /><br />\r\nOfficials are reluctant to comment on any events that include the bitPimps as they fear it will only encourage the citizens who haven\\\'t sided with the gang, and enrage those citizens that have already sided with the gang. Rumor has it that there\\\'s going to be another bitPimps Racing Circuit opening in another country, but nothing has been confirmed yet. There\\\'s also been talk of a possible race happening on the bitPimps home turf in St. Louis - among the prizes mentioned was a real life \\"albino\\", he\\\'s an 8 year-old boy from Switzerland given to the bitPimps after a nasty \\"tea-bagging\\" incident gone wrong.', 1);
INSERT INTO News VALUES (12, 'G\\\'s Up Ho\\\'s Down As The Red Light Descends Upon The City', '2003-02-23 00:00:00', 'In light of the recent slaying of once bitPimps King of Ho\\\'s DaGeneral, another pimp has stepped up to the challenge and is quickly turning the red lights on all over the city.', 'From: Claude Balls and Noodles<br />\r\nPNN Pimp City Bureau<br /><br />\r\n<strong>PIMP CITY, Pimpafornia (PNN)<br />\r\nIn light of the recent slaying of once bitPimps King of Ho\\\'s DaGeneral, another pimp has stepped up to the challenge and is quickly turning the red lights on all over the city.</strong><br /><br />\r\nLeather and high-heels are the latest trend now that once soccer moms are now turning tricks for the Kings of Swingin Dingalings, the bitPimps.<br /><br />\r\nWith DaGeneral gone, there was chaos through-out the city as every pimp hopeful wanted to stake a claim in all the action left behind. The bitPimps gang themselves tried to control the prostitution ring themselves, but with constantly running from an array of government agencies and running an ever expanding city and crew - they just couldn\\\'t keep up.<br /><br />\r\n<img src=\\"../../images/member_images/surveillance/120x115/kwikbb_f.jpg\\" width=\\"130\\" height=\\"115\\" name=\\"copyImg\\" alt=\\"News\\" align=\\"right\\" />The ensuing turmoil showed the bitPimps as a whole that they needed to assign more bosses to specific duties and tasks, that\\\'s when they introduced the newest member into the executive level - kwikbb.<br /><br />\r\nNot long after kwikbb was assigned, the once discombobulated prostitution in the city instantly turned back into the profitable and excity industry it once was. Many signs of kwikbb\\\'s attitude towards prostitution showed immediatly as low-level pimps clinging onto what was once DaGeneral\\\'s stables, were dropping off like flies. Police and bitPimps executives knew they had chosen a dangerously effective boss and expected to see many more changes to come.<br /><br />\r\nPNN\\\'s own Claude Balls sat down for a candid interview with the now new King of Ho\\\'s kwikbb, here\\\'s what transpired:<br />\r\n<strong>Claude Balls:</strong> There are rumors flying around the city now, since you\\\'ve basically taken over the prostitution ring for the bitPimps, some are claiming you are connected with DaGeneral\\\'s death. What do you have to say about that?<br />\r\n<strong>kwikbb:</strong> Yes it\\\'s true, I have assumed the role of King of Ho\\\'s in this city. To get that status, I had to control all the chaos that arose after DaGeneral\\\'s death. For that, I now have some enemies jealous of my position and they are gunning for me. They\\\'ll try anything they can to get me out.<br />\r\n<strong>Claude Balls:</strong> So you don\\\'t deny that you are connected with DaGeneral\\\'s disappearance?!<br />\r\n<strong>kwikbb:</strong> Oh no! No, not all, I have nothing to do with DaGeneral\\\'s death. Like I said, I have enemies now, they\\\'re basically trying to spread rumors that I killed DaGeneral. Nothing could be farther from the truth.<br />\r\n<strong>Claude Balls:</strong> So now that you are the new King of Ho\\\'s, what is it like? I mean besides having to watch your back, getchur dollas and sit back Big Willie style.<br />\r\n<strong>kwikbb:</strong> If you\\\'re asking me about all the perks and positive points of the job, I\\\'ll admit, there are many. Just to name a few would be to tell you that I had your mother, sister, and wife... all the same time!<br />\r\n<strong>Claude Balls:</strong> You son of a biatch! This interview is over, and now I must to tell you... watch your muthafuckin back!', 1);
INSERT INTO News VALUES (13, 'Flames Rage and Take Out a bitPimps Crew Member\\\'s Crib', '2003-03-21 00:00:00', 'A suspicious fire raged through the crib of kwikbb, a high ranking bitPimps gang member, destroying everything - kwikbb escapes, his belongings didn\\\'t make it.', 'From: Claude Balls and Noodles<br />\r\nPNN Pimp City Bureau<br /><br />\r\n<strong>PIMP CITY, Pimpafornia (PNN)<br />\r\nA suspicious fire raged through the crib of kwikbb, a high ranking bitPimps gang member, destroying everything - kwikbb escapes, his belongings didn\\\'t make it.</strong><br /><br />\r\n<img src=\\"../../images/member_images/surveillance/120x115/kwikbb_f.jpg\\" width=\\"130\\" height=\\"115\\" name=\\"copyImg\\" alt=\\"News\\" align=\\"right\\" />Other high ranking bitPimps gang members were made aware of the fire late wednesday night as kwikbb ran up da club, sweaty and covered in grime. The startling image of such a high class pimp in such disarray made other members very anxious and confused.<br /><br />\r\nKwikbb busted out with the story of how he is now homeless due to the fire that roared through his pad, gutting the entire place and destroying all personal belongings. The bitPimps gang immediately went into action as they scoured the remains and the rest of the city for any clues as to how this fire was started.<br /><br />\r\nReports of a unit on another floor, possibley having started the fire due to an electrical problem, surfaced as the tenants searched for new places to live. PNN caught up with several residents who are now searching for a new place to live, when asked about the suspicions of the fire - residents were very reluctant to speak. Most people believe the fire was started due to recent rivalries after the apparent death of DaGeneral and Kwikbb stepping in to fill the spot the slain leader once filled.<br /><br />\r\nThrough \\\'kwik\\\' thinking, kwikbb was able to save several of his more precious items like his bits, though his wild char-g was one of the victims. When interviewed about the fire, kwibb had this to say, \\"Well I\\\'ve relocated and I gotta say that my new cribs a palace compared to the shit hole I used to reside in... plus as an added bonus I\\\'m 2 min. away from work - free ho\\\'s all day and night! But alas with the good come the bad, I\\\'m further away from the LHS (Local Hooker\\\'s Station) where I collects all my paper from my shorties, so it\\\'s kind of a biatch to get back and forth - I\\\'m thinking of paying a little retarded kid to do the leg work for me, but I\\\'m worried he might try to sneak in hump with his little mushroom cap - I don\\\'t want him tainting my merchandise!<br />\r\nSo all and all it wasn\\\'t a bad thing that my home burned... in a matter of speaking anyway lol... <br />\r\nStill gotta back over there and get pics before they tear it down.\\"', 1);
INSERT INTO News VALUES (14, 'Numbers of bitPimp gang members increase - P.C.P.D. on the lookout for more danger', '2003-04-20 00:00:00', 'With the number of bitPimps increasing daily, the P.C.P.D. expects more dangerous crimes, \\"larger scale crimes and an increase in the number of crimes is what we\\\'re expecting to see develop\\", T Dogg Jenkins.', 'From: Claude Balls and Noodles<br />\r\nPNN Pimp City Bureau<br /><br />\r\n<strong>PIMP CITY, Pimpafornia (PNN)<br />\r\nWith the number of bitPimps increasing daily, the P.C.P.D. expects more dangerous crimes, \\"larger scale crimes and an increase in the number of crimes is what we\\\'re expecting to see develop\\", T Dogg Jenkins.</strong><br /><br />\r\n<img src=\\"../../images/member_images/surveillance/120x115/noxorc_f.jpg\\" width=\\"130\\" height=\\"115\\" name=\\"copyImg\\" alt=\\"News\\" align=\\"right\\" />Different and seemingly odd crimes have sprung up all over the city, police blame the bitPimps for many of them. Recently, police were on the lookout for two pimps known as noxorc and hogjowlz. The two were suspected in placing \\"booby traps\\" in a 6 square block radius in the heart of downtown Pimp City.<br /><br />\r\nPolice say noxorc made most of the devices while hogjowlz would go out and plant the devices in strategic areas. At one point, hogjowlz was seen dashing out the back door of a bar where he and noxorc are regulars, where he proceeded to hop in a Sponge Bob Squarepants modified bit.<br /><br />\r\n<img src=\\"../../images/member_images/surveillance/120x115/hogjowlz_f.jpg\\" width=\\"130\\" height=\\"115\\" name=\\"copyImg\\" alt=\\"News\\" align=\\"right\\" />Police were baffled, but caught a break in the case when they discovered 2 tubes of JB Weld, that\\\'s when their research paid off - one detective had remembered hogjowlz\\\'s fondness for the stuff.<br /><br />\r\nT Dogg Jenkins described them as small, dark, and pimped out, but didn\\\'t know what kind of plastic they were made of. P.C.P.D. spokesman T Dogg Jenkins said, \\"they might try to harm people if they get bored again and we advise anyone who sees them to run in the opposite direction before they catch you in one of their dual celled bits\\".<br /><br />\r\nIn other news, the cities convenient stores were raided today by swarms of citizens celebrating the day with a bad case of the munchies. Virtually no business was done on that day including tele-marketers who\\\'s severe cotton mouth hindered them from speaking on the phone.<br /><br />\r\nThe Easter Bunny was reportedly seen in a part of the city known to be a drug haven. Witnesses said they see him everytime around this year and claim that he stocks up before he has to go out on his deliveries. \\"He needs something to take the edge off. You and I only have to deal with our families, but that bunny has to deal with everyones families! poor guy...\\" said one man who wanted to remain anonymous.', 1);
INSERT INTO News VALUES (15, 'Truck of Bit Pimps Member Found in Back Alley, Officials Say Rival Gang ', '2003-05-20 00:00:00', 'The truck of a member of the Bit Pimps Gang was found by Pimp City Police yesterday in an alley behind the house of Tiny R/C gang member, tinyrc.', 'From: midget_man1387<br />\r\nPNN Pimp City Bureau<br /><br />\r\n<strong>PIMP CITY, Pimpafornia (PNN)<br />\r\nThe truck of a member of the Bit Pimps Gang was found by Pimp City Police yesterday in an alley behind the house of Tiny R/C gang member, tinyrc.</strong><br /><br />\r\n<img src=\\"../../images/member_images/mm_shot1.jpg\\" width=\\"461\\" height=\\"221\\" name=\\"copyImg\\" alt=\\"News\\" /><br />\r\nNeighbors to the evil man called police after they saw a truck they’d seen in the suburbs of Pimp City shot up and trashed. Officials believe that the truck’s owner, Bit Pimps gang member payaso was busy working on a few Glorias of his and blasting country music, when the rival gang swept in and took the truck. Therefore, because of payaso’s music, he was not able to hear the gang steal his truck.<br /><br />\r\nOfficials say that the gang members of Tiny R/C then took the car through fire, busted out a couple of windows, shot the car with machine guns, and tore the car up. They then \\"left it for dead\\" in the alley behind tinyrc’s house. Luckily, m_m1387 news was able to get a couple of action shots of the trashing, as we see the gang driving the vehicle through fire.<br /><br />\r\nThe reason for the demolition is unknown, but insiders believe it has something to do with tinyrc thinking payaso was a traitor, as payaso posed as a friend to the gang. Obviously there was some turmoil between the two gangs, which seemed unaware to the public.<br /><br />\r\nThe truck, seen to the right following the damage, was a bB, modified by the Bit Pimps gang, and used often by the leaders of the gang, payaso, CaboWabo, and kwikbb.<br /><br />\r\n<img src=\\"../../images/member_images/mm_shot2.jpg\\" width=\\"195\\" height=\\"131\\" name=\\"copyImg\\" alt=\\"News\\" align=\\"right\\" />One gang member, who claims to be DarkTari, stated, \\"We’re gonna get these bastards.... I don’t care what it takes, but we’ll get those bitches back for what they’ve done,\\" as he flexed his muscles and showed off his muscular physique. Payaso replied by saying, \\"They just started a war. I’m just damn glad it wasn’t one of my Glorias. They mess with the Glorias, they will go down.\\"<br /><br />\r\nAs previously stated, payaso was customizing one of his many Glorias, a car which he loves with all of his heart and does work on constantly. CaboWabo, a fellow gang leader, saw the truck driving away from payaso’s house, but thought nothing of it, he says. \\"I just figured he was out of Vaseline or something.\\"<br /><br />\r\nTinyrc remains in jail tonight awaiting trial, along with fellow Tiny R/C gang members xatu, Namuna, Pie, and yellowsupra. No word yet on charges or bail.<br />', 1);
INSERT INTO News VALUES (16, 'Armored Car Robbery, BitPimps Suspected', '2003-06-13 00:00:00', 'Pimp City Police officers were called to the Checkers Fast Food Joint on 13th & Homie Ave. in response to a Dept. Of Defense Armored Car Robbery.', 'From: DarkTari<br />\r\nPNN Pimp City Bureau<br /><br />\r\n<strong>PIMP CITY, Pimpafornia (PNN)<br />\r\nPimp City Police officers were called to the Checkers Fast Food Joint on 13th & Homie Ave. in response to a Dept. Of Defense Armored Car Robbery.</strong><br /><br />\r\n<img src=\\"../../images/member_images/pr_checkers.jpg\\" width=\\"200\\" height=\\"150\\" name=\\"copyImg\\" alt=\\"News\\" align=\\"right\\" />When Police arrived at the scene the robbers had gotten away with an undisclosed amount of cash and other items. Pimp City Police Chief, I. Gotcha said \\"that it looks like the work of the BitPimp Gang. These thugs have been reeking havoc in the uptown areas in a \r\ntake-over plot with the rival TRC gang. We don’t have any one particular suspect at this time but a parking lot surveillance camera caught a glimps of the getaway Bit.\\" Apparently the DOD drivers had made their last pickup and decided to stop and get something to eat before clocking back to the station. There were large amounts of cash and certain DOT hardware that were stolen. DOT Officials declined to comment only saying that \\"This BitPimp Gang has stepped over the line this time\\".<br /><br />\r\nAccording to Checker workers, two guys, one muscular and the other slim & spooky strapped a chain to the rear door of the Armored Car and the rear of the getaway Bit and pulled the door open. Then they dumped large bags & some boxes in the trunk of the Bit and took off down the street. They took off so fast, he hadda be runnin Nitros one witness said.', 1);
INSERT INTO News VALUES (17, 'Another bitPimps Gang Member Goes Missing, P.C.P.D. Left Holding Their Bags', '2003-09-07 00:00:00', 'The bitPimps ring leaders did well to keep their latest loss a secret from the public for so long. P.C.P.D. left wondering how they were the last to know again.', 'From: Claude Balls & Noodles<br />\r\nPNN Pimp City Bureau<br /><br />\r\n<strong>PIMP CITY, Pimpafornia (PNN)<br />\r\nThe bitPimps ring leaders did well to keep their latest loss a secret from the public for so long. P.C.P.D. left wondering how they were the last to know again.</strong><br /><br />\r\n<img src=\\"../../images/member_images/surveillance/120x115/kwikbb_f.jpg\\" width=\\"130\\" height=\\"115\\" name=\\"copyImg\\" alt=\\"News\\" align=\\"right\\" />The latest pimp to go missing from the bitPimps gang has been revealed as kwikbb. The once notorious and highly revered pimp went missing in early summer as far as can be told. The bitPimps ring leaders aren\\\'t talking and have released no public statements. From what PNN has un-covered through various sources, kwikbb went missing sometime early this summer. Nothing was mentioned to the public and eventually people started to notice the once highly public figure had nearly dropped off the face of the earth as he never seemed to show up in public.<br /><br />\r\nAs the rumors started to fly, P.C.P.D. finally caught wind of the dis-appearance and have launched their own internal investigations; one to figure out what happened to kwikbb and another to figure why they were the last one\\\'s to know about this incident. Several reports have kwikbb last spotted in a night club owned and run by the bitPimps mob, leaving abruptly with a two duffle bags. One bag\\\'s contents was cash, hundred dollar bills, suspected to be part of the cash from the latest \\"Checker\\\'s Heist\\", as it\\\'s come to be known, and estimated to contain over $100,000 US dollars. The contents of the second bag was later revealed as skunk bud.<br /><br />\r\nP.C.P.D. has setup yet another tip hotline for anyone who might have any information regarding the dis-appearance, and now have round-the-clock operators standing by. At this point they\\\'ve had to outsource the work as the load has been too great after not being able to solve any of the crimes that might involve any bitPimps gang member or crew.<br /><br />\r\nThe bitPimps ring leaders are being tight lipped as usual and are saying nothing and seems as if it\\\'s business as usual for this ruling gang.', 1);
INSERT INTO News VALUES (18, 'Homie Porn/Prostitution Ring Busted, City Plunged Into BJ Withdrawal', '2003-10-03 00:00:00', 'P.C.P.D. spokesman T Dogg Jenkins announced that a sting had managed to net an infamous homie porn/prostitution ring believed to be run out of the well known Mr. Pickles\\\' Snatch Shack Night Club, a common bitPimps hang-out - also owned by the bitPimps.', 'From: Claude Balls & Noodles<br />\r\nPNN Pimp City Bureau<br /><br />\r\n<strong>PIMP CITY, Pimpafornia (PNN)<br />\r\nP.C.P.D. spokesman T Dogg Jenkins announced that a sting had managed to net an infamous homie porn/prostitution ring believed to be run out of the well known Mr. Pickles\\\' Snatch Shack Night Club, a common bitPimps hang-out - also owned by the bitPimps.</strong><br /><br />\r\n<a href=\\"http://bitpimps.lixlink.com/images/movies/cabowabo/gone_wild.wmv\\"><img src=\\"http://bitpimps.lixlink.com/images/movies/cabowabo/thumbs/gone_wild.jpg\\" width=\\"200\\" height=\\"150\\" name=\\"copyImg\\" alt=\\"News\\" align=\\"right\\" border=\\"0\\" /></a>Hundreds of tapes were uncovered as officers made the bust late Tuesday night at Mr. Pickles\\\' Snatch Shack. Police are still sifting through evidence and plan on bringing charges of prostitution and illegal pornography against several key figures in the bitPimps gang.<br /><br />\r\nThis comes just weeks after it was confirmed that Mr. Pickles\\\' Snatch Shack had added a new, state-of-the-art day care center to its already vast array of capabilities. The lush 8 bedroom, 8 bath day care center, which according to Mr. Pickles, will \\"allow customers to enjoy a night out watching T & A while the kiddies get educated on STD\\\'s via the media room which plays <em>So, you say it burns when you pee?</em> all day, everyday.\\"<br /><br />\r\n\\"Nothing can stop the Tiny Tots Up, Ho\\\'s Down Play and Learning Center\\", said Mr. Pickles. The center has been furnished with all sorts of safe and fun learning toys for the children to use on themselves and eachother. Like the \\"My First Electric Dildo\\" and the \\"Make Your Weiner Spit\\" toys, some of the most popular toys, the new \\"Sit and Jizz\\" has huge waiting lines until one can get on and learn and play.<br /><br />\r\nPolice un-covered the ring when they received a tip from a disgruntled employee of the day care that warned police of the pending dangers for children and the spread of viruses as the toys have never been cleaned or sanitized. Disguised as pornographic toy maintenance repair men, police managed to work their way into the day care where they immediately found little Timmy going at it with Susie on top of a stack of Dr. Seuss books, while another classmate, Barry (6) filmed the couple.<br /><br />\r\nPolice say they are trying to shut down the Mr. Pickles\\\' Snatch Shack Day Care Center but have no idea when or how it will be done.', 1);
INSERT INTO News VALUES (19, 'Sex, Lies, and Fuzzy Pictures', '2004-04-01 00:00:00', 'Under cover, under a Ju Jitsu uniform, and under a prostitute, our man Bird digs deep to get the full scoop on recent politicals events.', 'From: Bird<br />\r\nPNN Pimp City Bureau<br /><br />\r\n<strong>PIMP CITY, Pimpafornia (PNN)<br />\r\nUnder cover, under a Ju Jitsu uniform, and under a prostitute, our man Bird digs deep to get the full scoop on recent politicals events.</strong><br /><br />\r\n<img src=\\"../../images/member_images/pr_spyglasses.jpg\\" width=\\"200\\" height=\\"110\\" name=\\"copyImg\\" alt=\\"News\\" align=\\"right\\" border=\\"1\\" />During Bird\\\'s covert mission, he wore a wire along with some spy glasses that made him look like he was an 87 year-old man. That didn\\\'t go over well and he was having a hard time finding a quality prostitute so he had bring in a \\"helper\\" who looked and felt comfortable wearing glasses from a late night info-mercial.<br /><br />\r\nWe\\\'re now proud to bring you the imagery and conversation captured by our under cover agent Bird.<br /><br />\r\n\\"My fellow Americans, I have interrupted your regularly scheduled programming to address a serious breach in our homeland security..\\"<br /><br />\r\n<img src=\\"http://bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpGallery/albums/userpics/10019/1.jpg\\" width=\\"363\\" height=\\"366\\" name=\\"copyImg\\" alt=\\"News\\" border=\\"1\\" /><br />\r\n\\"After being roused from my daily, um, er, karate class...\\"<br /><br />\r\n<img src=\\"http://bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpGallery/albums/userpics/10019/2.jpg\\" width=\\"387\\" height=\\"337\\" name=\\"copyImg\\" alt=\\"News\\" border=\\"1\\" /><br />\r\n\\"...by the secret service, I was informed that the notorious \\"bitPimps\\" syndicate was attempting to overthrow the state of Pimpafornia by massing at the state assembly building.\\"\r\n<br /><br />\r\n<img src=\\"http://bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpGallery/albums/userpics/10019/3.jpg\\" width=\\"400\\" height=\\"189\\" name=\\"copyImg\\" alt=\\"News\\" border=\\"1\\" /><br />\r\n\\"I got to flyin\\\' in my Air Force One immediately, to assist the governor of Pimpafornia, Aahnold SportsnJager, at the assembly\\".<br /><br />\r\n<img src=\\"http://bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpGallery/albums/userpics/10019/4.jpg\\" width=\\"400\\" height=\\"174\\" name=\\"copyImg\\" alt=\\"News\\" border=\\"1\\" /><br />\r\n\\"Ya, deez peemps vill not be staging any coup in de state of Peempaahfohnia vile Ah\\\'m de guuvuhnaaah\\"<br />\r\n(cheesy Austrian accent)<br /><br />\r\n\\"We will now send in the P.C.P.D to attempt to negotiate with the ringleaders\\".<br /><br />\r\n<img src=\\"http://bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpGallery/albums/userpics/10019/5.jpg\\" width=\\"400\\" height=\\"300\\" name=\\"copyImg\\" alt=\\"News\\" border=\\"1\\" /><br />\r\n\\"Um, fellas, uh, you think you can disperse immediately? The president and the governor are trying to avoid a confrontation... plus they\\\'re punks...\\"<br /><br />\r\n\\"Oh hell no! Tell those fools they gotta come tell us to our face!\\"<br /><br />\r\n\\"Ok, fellas... calm down... Can I offer you one of these here tasty donuts?\\"<br /><br />\r\n\\"So, as you can see, or not, due to the mysterious disappearance of pic #6(dammit!), that governor SportsnJager and myself were accosted by those treacherous thugs\\".<br /><br />\r\n<img src=\\"http://bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpGallery/albums/userpics/10019/7.jpg\\" width=\\"400\\" height=\\"174\\" name=\\"copyImg\\" alt=\\"News\\" border=\\"1\\" /><br />\r\n\\"Ya, vee deed naaht know zat zey haaahd a taaaaahnk!\\"<br />\r\n(cheesy Austrian accent again)<br /><br />\r\n<img src=\\"http://bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpGallery/albums/userpics/10019/8.jpg\\" width=\\"400\\" height=\\"300\\" name=\\"copyImg\\" alt=\\"News\\" border=\\"1\\" /><br />\r\n\\"So, here are the new leaders of the free world, the notorious bitPimps\\"<br /><br />\r\n<img src=\\"http://bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpGallery/albums/userpics/10019/9.jpg\\" width=\\"400\\" height=\\"188\\" name=\\"copyImg\\" alt=\\"News\\" border=\\"1\\" /><br />\r\nThe End', 1);
INSERT INTO News VALUES (20, 'Is It Out with the Old and In with the New on bitPimps?', '2004-04-21 00:00:00', 'With the recent disappearance\\\'s of several high profile pimps and the introduction of several new pimps making their mark, citizens begin to wonder what\\\'s really going on.', 'From: Claude Balls & Noodles<br />\r\nPNN Pimp City Bureau<br /><br />\r\n<strong>PIMP CITY, Pimpafornia (PNN)<br />\r\nWith the recent disappearance\\\'s of several high profile pimps and the introduction of several new pimps making their mark, citizens begin to wonder what\\\'s really going on.</strong><br /><br />\r\nIn the past several months, some very high profile pimps have seemed to of disappeared. For what reasons, nobody is sure - and that is where the mystery begins.<br /><br />\r\nThe citizens of Pimp City have even recognized a lot of new faces to replace some of the past pimps who have disappeared. Here\\\'s just some of what citizens had to say when we took our story to the people in our \\"Getting The Beat On The Street\\" episode.<br /><br />\r\n<img src=\\"http://bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpGallery/albums/userpics/10001/thumb_09_ahh5hit_2.jpg\\" width=\\"134\\" height=\\"100\\" name=\\"copyImg\\" alt=\\"News\\" align=\\"right\\" border=\\"1\\" />One time tap dancing legend Skull Crusher Johnson had this to say; \\"I wuz walkin\\\' t\\\'de sto\\\'e and saw dis wheels goin\\\' real slow likes dey wuz lookin\\\' fo\\\' some fool. Well it turns out dey wuz lookin\\\' fo\\\' some fool, some fool t\\\'rob. Co\\\' got d\\\' beat!\\" Mr. Johnson was robbed at gun point of his tap shoes and his chronic. Witnesses reported seeing a white vehicle believed to be that of one Ahh5hit both before and after the robbery. Rumors are also reported to be flying through the ranks of the bitPimps that a one Son_Gokou (aka CharlieBrown) may have been involved in Ahh5hit\\\'s disappearance.<br /><br />\r\nP.C.P.D. were looking for the car, evidence pointed them in the direction of a pimp who goes by the name Azimov. When police arrived at the Azimov’s crib, they found only Son_Gokou suspiciously peering through windows. Gokou has been under constant surveillance by the bitPimps as well as the P.C.P.D. ever since the two suspicious incidents.<br /><br />\r\nJust as the city seemed to start to settle back in to it’s funky groove, yet more high profile pimps fell off the radar. VooDooMafia mysteriously disappeared along HirotoR34. No evidence has yet been released and no statements have been made. Police have kept up their typical public announcements aimed at helping them solve crimes and getting laid by advertising latest missing person cases on milk cartons and personally manning the rape crisis phone lines.', 1);
INSERT INTO News VALUES (21, 'bitPimps Marijuana Crop Saved From Club Fire', '2004-05-16 00:00:00', 'Firefighters rescue 6,200 potted plants that will be used for evidence - that is if the bitPimps don\\\'t say different.', 'From: Claude Balls & Noodles<br />\r\nPNN Pimp City Bureau<br /><br />\r\n<strong>PIMP CITY, Pimpafornia (PNN)<br />\r\nFirefighters rescue 6,200 potted plants that will be used for evidence - that is if the bitPimps don\\\'t say different.</strong><br /><br />\r\nA Pimp City man\\\'s (hue35) mariguana crop almost went up in smoke Thursday, but firefighter\\\'s fast work saved the plenitude of potted plants.<br /><br />\r\n<img src=\\"http://bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpForum/images/avatars/407a0a2e40898c6a12768.jpg\\" width=\\"80\\" height=\\"80\\" name=\\"copyImg\\" alt=\\"News\\" align=\\"right\\" border=\\"1\\" />The bitPimp known as hue35 planned to take care of the small blaze himself P.C.P.D. said. But the nearby \\"Titty Twister\\" didn\\\'t sell fire exteinguishers. With that, hue35 thought that he found the perfect alternative — baking soda — and quickly returned to the \\"Titty Twister\\" at 1420 Burns Road, P.C.P.D. said.<br /><br />\r\nMuch to his chagrin, P.C.P.D. firefighters and police had already come to his aid. Firefighters used water to douse the electrical fire in his attic, said deputy fire marshal Marshmellow Holmstrom.<br /><br />\r\n<img src=\\"http://archive.aclu.org/graphics/leaf.jpg\\" width=\\"177\\" height=\\"200\\" name=\\"copyImg\\" alt=\\"News\\" align=\\"right\\" border=\\"1\\" />The 6,200 marijuana plants growing in the basement below were saved — for P.C.P.D. evidence. The blaze was caused by an overloaded electrical outlet — thought to be from a FET modded lighting system — P.C.P.D. said.<br /><br />\r\nCords from the outlet led to lights typically used for indoor marijuana gardens, P.C.P.D. said. Firefighters arrived at the crib about 11:40 P.M. to find smoke, flames, and hot dogs both shooting and being served from the back of the house.<br /><br />\r\n\\"They saw what was going on in the crib and called police\\" P.C.P.D. said. The fire was contained to the basement; the blaze didn\\\'t get enough oxygen to spread. P.C.P.D. chared hue35 with manufacture and possesion of marijuana, P.C.P.D. police Lt. T Dogg Jenkins said.', 1);
